                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The story, the pacing, the character development, .... pretty much all of it, left me feeling like a castaway.  \r\nThe obsession with the female protoganist's conflict of whether to drink or not, just left me exhausted.  How does one write a story like an endless monologue and package it as an entertainment?  \r\n\r\nI have no recollection of ever buying this game/visual novel, so I must have been totally drunk out of my mind when I clicked that purchase button.  The dangers of insobriety.",
